{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3142230/extras/d20f952a106a8bc500cdd4f56dc14ad9.poster.avif?t=1769680699\" width=1170 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3142230/extras/d20f952a106a8bc500cdd4f56dc14ad9.webm?t=1769680699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3142230/extras/d20f952a106a8bc500cdd4f56dc14ad9.mp4?t=1769680699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>ABOUT WUMMSEN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Wummsen Village</strong> \u2013 the place where genetically modified cacti throw punches or volleyballs (depending on the discipline) straight around their non-existent ears!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your friends and jump into chaotic battles with <strong>2\u20134 players</strong>, either in <strong>teams</strong> or <strong>free-for-all</strong> mode.<br>Punch, kick, and combo your way through colorful and occasionally <i>completely insane</i> stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core principle:</strong> <i>Schallern.</i><br>(That\u2019s German for: hit hard, laugh harder.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3142230/extras/c5e9ca9c043a77d59be96fbccd3105e6.poster.avif?t=1769680699\" width=720 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3142230/extras/c5e9ca9c043a77d59be96fbccd3105e6.webm?t=1769680699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3142230/extras/c5e9ca9c043a77d59be96fbccd3105e6.mp4?t=1769680699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wummsen gives you our special <strong>Revolver Combo System</strong> \u2013 every attack automatically cycles to the next,<br>allowing you to pull off full combos with <strong>just one button</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That means even newcomers can start smacking right away, without spending half the evening explaining controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But here\u2019s the real twist: <strong>you load the revolver yourself.</strong><br>Each slot in the revolver holds one attack, and you\u2019ve got two <i>clips</i> of three moves each.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think of it like building two playlists with your favorite tracks \u2013 once a \u201csong\u201d (attack) finishes, the next one starts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2\u20134 Players</strong> \u2013 local couch brawling or via <strong>Steam Remote Play</strong> <i>(online mode in development)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Controller Support</strong> \u2013 for that true \u201cWumms\u201d feeling (if in doubt: button-mashing recommended)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Matches</strong> \u2013 perfect for short sessions and party nights (around <strong>5 min per round</strong>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Combo System</strong> \u2013 perform flashy combos with a single button</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic Stages</strong> \u2013 from simple arenas to the <i>Festival Stage</i>, where even the music fights back</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Volleyball Mode</strong> \u2013 for <i>Blobby Volley</i> fans and physics-driven madness lovers alike</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cartoony 3D in 2D Gameplay</strong> \u2013 bright, colorful, stylized, and pure fun</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3142230/extras/c3e91c04cb1f43732139b459a1419fae.poster.avif?t=1769680699\" width=1170 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3142230/extras/c3e91c04cb1f43732139b459a1419fae.webm?t=1769680699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3142230/extras/c3e91c04cb1f43732139b459a1419fae.mp4?t=1769680699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME MODES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boxing</strong> \u2013 fists, feet, and faces will fly as you punch HP bars toward zero</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Volleyball</strong> \u2013 when the ball hits the ground, that\u2019s a point \u2014 only the Wummsers spiking and setting technique is a little funky</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EASY TO LEARN, HARD TO MASTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wummsen Village is so accessible that your friends can start fighting within <strong>30 seconds</strong>,<br>yet deep enough that you\u2019ll still discover <strong>new combos and tactics after 30 hours</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IN DEVELOPMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wummsen Village is currently in development.<br>The <strong>demo</strong> already includes couch co-op, Steam Remote Play, and some stages \u2014<br>with more <strong>characters</strong>, <strong>arenas</strong>, and <strong>game modes</strong> coming soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay tuned and <strong>join the Wummsen community</strong>\u00a0- Find us on\u00a0<i>Discord</i> or <i>Instagram</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3142230/extras/5d5b9f1206be78b0087e520b8bf88a49.poster.avif?t=1769680699\" width=1170 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3142230/extras/5d5b9f1206be78b0087e520b8bf88a49.webm?t=1769680699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3142230/extras/5d5b9f1206be78b0087e520b8bf88a49.mp4?t=1769680699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHY YOU SHOULD WUMMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When that blue shell hits and sends you from first to eighth place \u2014 some people get <i>a little</i> violent.<br>With Wummsen, you can let it all out <strong>without breaking your controller or friend.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just start a round, release your rage, and laugh it off together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love games like <strong>Gang Beasts</strong>, <strong>Stick Fight</strong>, or <strong>Duck Game</strong>, you\u2019ll feel right at home in <strong>Wummsen Village</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3142230?t=1769680699","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3142230/26191faca02f0789d6d41766d552e50d6d1c92f2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769680699","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3142230/37bd76c9a5ba33665ca67546d108660c41655970/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769680699","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3142230/37bd76c9a5ba33665ca67546d108660c41655970/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769680699","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Remote P